The admin console is distributed as a single executable jar that bundles
the ebms-core library, the ebms-h2-db-plugin and their third-party
dependencies. The generated THIRD-PARTY.txt file in the jar lists the
components and the license under which each component is distributed.

In particular, the following non-Apache-licensed components are bundled:

- The H2 database engine (com.h2database:h2), licensed under the Mozilla
  Public License, version 2.0 (MPL-2.0).
- The Jakarta API artifacts (jakarta.*), dual licensed under the EPL 2.0
  and GPL 2.0 with the Classpath Exception; only the API classes are
  bundled.
